       fb:'The learners should follow the longer marked route because the direct path is blocked by a fallen tree. A longer distance is acceptable when it provides a safer route.',
       fb_bi:'Dapat sundon kan mga estudyante an mas halabang markadong ruta ta nakaharang an natumbang kahoy sa direktang dalan. Mas marhay an mas halabang distansya kun ini an mas ligtas na ruta.',
       // Physics explanation: teacher's consolidated version (explanations.docx), formulas typeset as HTML
